IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0021.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 LC-12              PIC 9(2).
    05 DL-DD              PIC 9(3).
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 A-SC               PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 WS-PEN             PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM SUSPEND-CHECK
    PERFORM REFER-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "A-SC=" A-SC
    DISPLAY "WS-PEN=" WS-PEN
    STOP RUN.
SUSPEND-CHECK.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF LC-12 >= 3
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF LC-12 >= 4 AND DL-DD > 30
        MOVE 'S' TO A-SC
        ADD 100 TO WS-PEN
    END-IF.
REFER-COLLECTIONS.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF DL-DD > 48
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF DL-DD > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO A-SC
    END-IF.
